<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">SP01 设备能力检查</view>
    <view class="subtitle">仅读取本机和当前页面能力；没有网络请求、云服务调用或文件写入。</view>
    <button class="button button-primary" hover-class="button-hover" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="readDevice">重新读取</button>
    <button class="button" hover-class="button-hover" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="copyReport">复制结果</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">本机结果</view>
    <view class="report">{{report || '正在读取…'}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="hint">性能条目用于启动和首屏耗时核对，不代表 FPS。若无渲染器值，将原样记录“未提供”，不推断默认引擎。</view>
</view>
